    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d38-a1">

                <pb facs="0110" n="30" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg30"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Entzminger to Mr.
                            Bryan.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio, Box</hi> 252</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-05-17"><hi rendition="#italic">May 17,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Sir</hi>: It becomes my delightful duty to
                    inform you that the matter between myself and the president of the State of Rio,
                    His Excellency Gen. Quintino Bocayuva, was promptly and satisfactorily
                    dispatched by his excellency.</p>
                <p>I take occasion to once more express my hearty appreciation, and to return thanks
                    for your very kind offices.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. E. Entzminger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
